=====ALERT JOB CREATE=====
Usage: hops alert job create [OPTIONS] JOB_NAME

  Create an alert that fires on a job event (e.g. ``failed``).

  Args:     ctx: Click context.     job_name: The job name.     receiver:
  Receiver name the alert notifies.     status: Job event that triggers the
  alert.     severity: Alert severity.

Options:
  --receiver TEXT                 Alert receiver name.  [required]
  --status [finished|failed|killed|long_running]
                                  [required]
  --severity [warning|critical|info]
                                  [required]
  --json                          Output as JSON (machine-readable; for LLMs
                                  and scripts).
  -q, --quiet                     Suppress success/info/warn lines; print only
                                  data + errors.
  --verify / --no-verify          Verify the Hopsworks TLS certificate; --no-
                                  verify skips verification for self-signed /
                                  IP-SAN-mismatched certs.
  -h, --help                      Show this message and exit.
