=====RECEIVER CREATE HELP=====
Usage: hops alert receiver create [OPTIONS] NAME

  Create an alert receiver. Provide exactly one channel type.

  Args:     ctx: Click context.     name: Receiver name.     email: Email
  recipients.     slack: Slack channels.     pagerduty:
  ``service_key:routing_key`` pairs.     webhook: Webhook URLs.
  send_resolved: Notify on resolution too.

Options:
  --email TEXT            Email recipient; repeatable.
  --slack TEXT            Slack channel; repeatable.
  --pagerduty TEXT        PagerDuty "service_key:routing_key"; repeatable.
  --webhook TEXT          Webhook URL; repeatable.
  --send-resolved         Also notify when the alert resolves.
  --json                  Output as JSON (machine-readable; for LLMs and
                          scripts).
  -q, --quiet             Suppress success/info/warn lines; print only data +
                          errors.
  --verify / --no-verify  Verify the Hopsworks TLS certificate; --no-verify
                          skips verification for self-signed / IP-SAN-
                          mismatched certs.
  -h, --help              Show this message and exit.
